{"text": "MEMORANDUM\nSeptember 10, 1976\n\n70: Mr. M. I. Gastman\n\nFROM: Tom H. Mau\n\nSUBJECT: KGL Fastest Growing Claim - National\n\nIn response to your request for claim substantiation for the\n\u201cFastest Growing Cigarette Brand\" for Kent Golden Lights,\nthe following applies:\n\n1. We have used MSA share data information. The\nperiod of comparison is March 1976 through\nJune 1976.\n\n2. We have excluded brands with share of market\nlevels below .20.\n\nThis was done because of the unreliability\nof the share numbers due to rounding.\n\nThis also correlates to Maxwell, who does not\nreport volume percent change for any brand with\nless than a billion units. .\n3. In any rounding of the third decimal, we have\ngiven competition the up rounding and KGL down\nxounding and on the national basis KGL is the\nfastest growing brand.\n\nIn the fourth column, in the attached document, is the\npercentage increase or decrease of brands reported in MSA.\n(Those brands with a declining percent have a mark through them).\n\n6Le9z9S8",
